        'Prompt: “Predict whether a delivery will be late before it leaves.” A strong start identifies the known departure-time inputs, a clear meaning of late and a simple comparison rule. Recorded arrival time must not be used as a prediction input.',
        ('Spend 1 minute clarifying inputs and the target.', 'Spend 3 minutes on the baseline and checking plan.', 'Spend 1 minute on a likely failure and recovery.'),
