        'Use distance and parcel count available before departure. Compare with a simple baseline on later held-aside deliveries. Arrival time is leakage. Measure missed late deliveries and false alarms, then explain how changing routes or stale inputs could hurt performance.',
        {'mock interview': 'a practice interview with realistic constraints', 'leakage': 'using information unavailable when predicting', 'baseline': 'a simple method used to judge improvement'},
